<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $0.25/0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $0.25/0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>$0.25-0.50 lower. Trading moderately active. Top $55.25 per cwt.</p>
<p>- USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    55.00-55.25</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    54.75-55.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    53.75-54.75</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    52.75-53.75</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    51.25-52.75</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs 0.50 lower;  450-500 lbs no comparison</p>
<p>available due to limited supply yesterday; 500-650 lbs 0.50-1.00</p>
<p>higher. Top 49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    45.25, 40 hd No 1 46.50</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    Few Select 47.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    48.00-49.50</p>
</text>
